Section: 1 Introduction
Text: First, it requires the models to understand multilingual input texts, and generate multilin- gual target sequences. So both the encoder and the decoder should be pre-trained together. Second, the many-to-many nature of cross-lingual NLG increases language pairs with the square of the number of languages. Third, the predic- tion space of cross-lingual NLG is much larger than classi- ﬁcation tasks, which makes knowledge transfer of decoders quite critical.

